# RT-HWGI-NIGHT-LEAK: the cypress view of the Bistro night, hardware traced and at the level's own methods, against
# the path tracer of this build (it transmits light through two-sided foliage). The exposure is fixed in every frame.
# Numbers, linear luminance L, every frame averaged in 4x4 blocks, against pt, the same crop in both:
# [emissive_bar] the surfaces around the lit bar (the bar's own saturated pixels cut out), hw and level: L +-20 %, R/G +-10 %.
# [cypress_hw] the cypress, hw: L +-25 %, R/G and B/G +-15 %, pixels with any channel >= 0.99 no more than pt + 0.5 pp.
# [cypress_level] the cypress, level: L +-25 %, blocks under 0.1 of pt's median no more than pt + 5 pp.
# [disocclusion] move against settled: mean |dL| <= 10 % of settled L on the 16 px behind the cypress outline, no block
# darker than 0.8 of settled.
# THE CAUSE of the hardware cypress excess (388,228,10 against pt 94,62,0.5 before the change) is not established: the
# i_ frames each switch one method on top of the level and name the one that brings it. Nothing is claimed from [hw] alone.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Night.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: TAA"
Дано run Quality "Quality: Resolution.Percent 100"
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.AutoExposure false
Дано set 6039035132485441499 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ManualExposureEV100 0.5260688
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид level the picture of the scene and the level, nothing overridden
Тогда [emissive_bar]: the emissive triangles light their neighbours as in pt
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 120
Тогда-вид i_hw_shadows hardware shadows alone
Тогда [i_hw_shadows]: says whether the cypress excess comes with the shadows
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 120
Тогда-вид i_hw_reflections hardware reflections alone
Тогда [i_hw_reflections]: says whether the cypress excess comes with the reflections; the shield is not blue
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид i_hw_gi hardware traced indirect light alone
Тогда [i_hw_gi]: says whether the cypress excess comes with the indirect light
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Off"
Когда frames 120
Тогда-вид i_direct the direct light alone
Тогда [i_direct]: the direct light of the cypress at the level's shadows
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 120
Тогда-вид i_direct_hw_shadows the direct light alone under hardware shadows
Тогда [i_direct_hw_shadows]: the cypress direct light differs from i_direct by its shadow only
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 180
Тогда-вид hw shadows, reflections and indirect light hardware traced
Тогда [cypress_hw]: within the tolerance of pt
Тогда [hw]: the shield is teal as in pt, not blue
Когда run View "View mode: Base Color"
Когда frames 8
Тогда-вид basecolor the cypress base colour
Тогда [basecolor]: the albedo map at its tint, the same as in the level's path
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Off"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 64"
Когда frames 200
Тогда-вид pt the path tracer, the reference
Тогда [pt]: the cypress transmits light through its leaves, no fireflies
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows.Method HardwareTraced"
Когда frames 180
